/target
**/*.rs.bk
node_modules/
dist/
pkg/
.env
.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
CLAUDE.local.md
scratch/

# Editor and OS files. Not tidiness — `.vscode/settings.json` and `.idea/workspace.xml`
# routinely contain absolute paths, which on this machine means a home directory and an
# account name. Committing one would leak the identifier the pseudonym exists to protect.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. The spec requires reproducible builds with
# published hashes; an unlocked dependency graph makes that impossible to verify.
